[l_english.MODULE_PLANE_WEAPON_GRDATK_3A_PUMPKIN]
Pumpkin (Air)

[l_english.MODULE_PLANE_WEAPON_GRDATK_3A_PUMPKIN_desc]
Don’t trick or treat, since when you empty the pumpkin, it is no longer a good projectile.

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_PLANE_WEAPON_GRDATK_3A_PUMPKIN]
南瓜 (空)

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_PLANE_WEAPON_GRDATK_3A_PUMPKIN_desc]
别玩“不给糖就捣蛋”，因为当你把南瓜挖空后，它就不再是一个好的投掷物了。
